{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"わんわん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"101匹わんちゃんです。5匹です。\n96匹はどこやっていうはなしですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/30/5374563/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有能で有名なかりんが\n5着を1人で仕立てました。流石\nクオリティ高いし、\n1人ずつちょっと違うんですよo(｡･‧̫･｡)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに、\nえ？？牛のコスプレ？？\nと突っ込まれましたね。\nダルメシアンですからね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/30/5374563/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカメンバー\n結構言われたらしい（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ着てディズニーとか行きたかったな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/30/5374563/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカメンバー\n(七瀬、ゆうり、純奈、かりん、私)は、\nほんとに仲良しな5人組ですo(｡･‧̫･｡)o\nプライベートで遊んだり連絡とる仲"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/30/5374563/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから\nスイカって名前に特別な意味もないよ～笑\n温かく見守っててくださいฅ՞•ﻌ•՞ฅ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/30/5374563/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず、\n101匹わんちゃんのコスプレしたんだし\n101匹わんちゃん見てみよう、、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん\n犬派？猫派？o(｡･‧̫･｡)o\n(私は猫も犬もかったことあるからどっちもすき。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカメンバーの\nわんちゃん飼いたい人ー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/30/5374563/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/10/30/5374563/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(純奈ばっかり、七瀬を探せ。笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}